  "review_evidence": "Fresh literal primary FIRST4.6/p4.3 and pinned TensorizedGLSI contracts/definitions read and independent contract frozen before exact root candidate exposure. All35 source raw/LF pins and44 source-region snapshot hashes match. Exact678-byte candidate and anonymous type-only probe match all binders/lets/conclusions; root log prints Prop and no error, unused hf/hs warnings are type-proposition binder lint. Actual probability Gaussian law, coordinate derivative squares and coefficient2 match source background; C2compact supplies all real L1/derivative/slice conditions internally. Added fullsum L1 is a proper stronger derived output, not premise. Signed/zero cases and n0 Dirac singleton yield entropy0/emptyenergy0. No extra public certificates or false Pi norm interpretation. Only prospective statement approved; no implementation or source-topology theorem credit.",
  "review_run_sha256": "c96a91c292d5abbb74d4d44e6508b8994398fcd34e280bd242f079970f28d5b0",
  "reviewed_utc": "2026-10-07T08:09:54.470007+00:00",
